N/A: depends on S4 reaching an apply form. browser-use's primitive surface ALSO lacks a file-upload tool — there is no equivalent of mcp__playwright__browser_file_upload or mcp__chrome-devtools__upload_file. Even with the form rendered, resume upload via primitives would not be possible — clicking the file input (browser_click) only opens the native file picker which cannot be driven from inside the MCP.
